identifier: Endurance-CN
name: Endurance CN
abstract: Simplified Chinese localization patch for the Endurance parts pack
$kref: '#/ckan/github/starmatch666-droid/Endurance-CN'
license: MIT
author:
  - Cyber1j1e
resources:
  homepage: https://github.com/starmatch666-droid/Endurance-CN
tags:
  - config
  - localization
comment: >-
  Intentionally does not depend on Endurance: that mod is not on CKAN (NetKAN has no
  Endurance identifier, only EnduranceReconfig and EnduranceSpaceExplorationSystem).
  This is a text-only ModuleManager patch that activates when Endurance is installed
  manually, and is a no-op otherwise.
depends:
  - name: ModuleManager
install:
  - find: Endurance_CN
    install_to: GameData
